        <p>WHITE STAR LINE ROYAL MAIL STEAMERS. LIVERPOOL to NEW YORK via Queenstown. BRITANNIC Wed., Sept, 21 MAJESTIC Wed., Sept. 28. Second Cabin will be carried on toe voyage merged thus. Third Class passage at low rates including Outfit free of charge to New York, Boston, Philadelphia, or Baltimore. Apply to Ismer, Imam, and Co., Liverpool and 34. Leadenhall street, London 8.0.,</p>
