      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-09-16_WidnesExaminer_art0096" n="art0096">
        <head>EXAMINER, FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 16, 1898. RAILWAY TIME TABLE.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 16, 1898. RAILWAY TIME TABLE.</p>
        <p>SEPTEMBER</p>
