        <p>WARRINGTON TECHNICAL INSTITUTE. OPENING LECTURES. A LECTURE on "SULPHUR." illustrated with expert- oxents will be given by F. G. RUDDOCK. ESQ.. F.1.C., /etcher of Chemistry. lathe LECTURE-ROOM. MUSEUM- ' PTREEI on MONDAY, 19th inst., at 8 p.m. Admission tree. CHARLES MADELET, Secretary.</p>
